interface declaration.description:
TS 1.0
interface Name { ... }
Declares a named object shape used for structural typing; erased at compile time, no runtime representation.

interface extends.description:
TS 1.0
interface Name extends Base[, Base2] { ... }
An interface can extend one or more other interfaces (comma-separated), merging their members.

generic interface.description:
TS 1.0 (generics)
interface Name<T> { ... }
Parameterizes the interface's shape over a type variable, resolved at each usage site.
